[{"title":"登山巅下瞰克鲁伦河周览山川形势指麾营阵","author":"玄烨","text":"策马登崇冈，冈势亦崔嵬。\n浩浩见河流，迢递西隅来。\n杳然罕人迹，周览复徘徊。\n命我熊罴士，往驻山之隈。\n旌旗布林麓，寇见应疑猜。\n六师压其阵，贼势立崩摧。\n麾示诸部曲，号令肃风雷。\n俯视窟中?，殄灭同纤埃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37069,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"军中夜尝擐甲达旦","author":"玄烨","text":"四山风静建旌旄，帐外沙明片月高。\n除逆安民非得已，终宵擐甲敢言劳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37070,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"噶尔丹溃遁遂穷追之","author":"玄烨","text":"谩道爰爰?窟多，久从西路列雕戈。\n疾驰莫惮追奔力，须使穷禽入网罗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37071,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自贼中投诚来者皆宥之","author":"玄烨","text":"伐叛军声震若雷，奔亡贼势已全摧。\n龙荒所至皆苍赤，许尔投戈向化来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37072,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"遣使示皇太子捷音","author":"玄烨","text":"逋寇多年快剪除，风清塞北已回车。\n遥知念切驰相慰，驿骑南归赐捷书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37073,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"示宫中捷音","author":"玄烨","text":"向南瞻北斗，水际见飞鸿。\n雪照平沙月，云生大漠风。\n捷书传远塞，喜气溢深宫。\n奏凯鸣銮近，新荷夏正中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37074,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"班师拖陵留皇长子允禔殿后示之","author":"玄烨","text":"北伐经时铁马驰，自春徂夏历边陲。\n炎风暑雨归来日，留待旋镳抚六师。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37075,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行间赐大学士张玉书","author":"玄烨","text":"畴昔谋康阜，除顽事战攻。\n若非扬九伐，何以靖三农。\n古义严声讨，儒臣在折冲。\n遐荒风雪里，扈跸纪军容。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37076,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"外藩诸部落络绎来贺宴赉之","author":"玄烨","text":"诸部名王集，扶携绕御营。\n皆言清朔漠，从此乐生成。\n喜溢车书会，欢腾鼓角声。\n朕怀勤抚恤，所志在休兵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37077,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南口","author":"玄烨","text":"銮舆历远度龙城，已近郊圻一日程。\n时雨润来山翠重，更添高下小溪声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37078,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"入京见百官耆民童稚欢迎道周","author":"玄烨","text":"星斿葆羽禁城闉，雨霁郊坰不动尘。\n旭日薰风归凯路，黄童白叟太平人。\n正逢师至经三月，敢比苗顽格七旬。\n从此普天无战斗，更将休养勖臣邻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37079,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赐将军孙思克","author":"玄烨","text":"天讨恭行日，军威战捷时。\n列营张犄角，扼吭有偏师。\n立见穷追尽，能承节制奇。\n鹰扬资远略，宿望在西陲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37080,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"朕偶至潭柘览老和尚照福画像因而有感故作诗赐之","author":"玄烨","text":"法像俨然参涅槃，皆因大梦住山间。\n若非明镜当台语，笑指真图并戒坛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37081,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赐皇太子生辰诗","author":"玄烨","text":"百岁桐长老，千年松满枝。\n万峰迎瑞气，亿兆庆灵芝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37082,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"国舅佟国维六十寿诗以赐之","author":"玄烨","text":"领袖高门称退让，英华雅望冠椒房。\n谦和不恃勋臣贵，谨恪能承宠眷长。\n鹤算天增筹国老，松年仙授养生方。\n齐眉共享团圆庆，特赐流霞捧寿觞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37083,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"静明园喜雨","author":"玄烨","text":"西山初夏玉泉清，暮雨随风满凤城。\n四野皆沾比屋庆，八荒尽望乐丰盈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37084,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"密云作","author":"玄烨","text":"连年驻跸此城隈，云谷无尘金碧堆。\n斗室何妨宇宙志，晨昏常掖辇舆回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37085,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"石匣营作","author":"玄烨","text":"青岭横峰荫薜萝，时方小暑绿新荷。\n蒲编诗兴光岩穴，虎士桓桓扣角歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37086,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仿唐人戏作","author":"玄烨","text":"一村耕作两村耕，两处缘来一处成。\n下止丰亨上土旱，南山落雨北山晴。\n河流数转河流去，任性无常任性行。\n万物参差须格物，一生何苦太关情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37087,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读书得风云月露字因而分作四句中成绝一首","author":"玄烨","text":"吟风欲识诗书髓，弄月须参天地心。\n莫遣云尘绕八极，时时湛露沛高深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37088,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"塞外新秋","author":"玄烨","text":"松塞云峰转，边陲秋气长。\n枫林消溽暑，柏叶送清香。\n禾黍宜关外，情怀喜夜凉。\n年丰还重谷，处处有馀粮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37089,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜闻雷雨大作晓赋志喜","author":"玄烨","text":"秋成望泽意悬悬，驻辇山庄已数天。\n雷送溪声连夜雨，炉凝香霭润鸾笺。\n开襟漏报残钟曙，破梦茶敲活火煎。\n半百无文惟自乐，顿教心地作清涟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37090,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得芳气有无中","author":"玄烨","text":"大儒吟咏物，正自托诗情。\n气质原含内，芬芳远向荣。\n藕花中外直，绛雪有无名。\n惟愿菊兰气，山林勿使轻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37091,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"早起看雪","author":"玄烨","text":"凛冽朔风舞雪，逶迤静夜高眠。\n起听芸窗万籁，依然寻句韦编。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37092,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏盆中松竹梅各一首 其一 松","author":"玄烨","text":"岁寒坚后雕，秀萼山林性。\n移根黼座傍，可托青松柄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37093,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏盆中松竹梅各一首 其二 竹","author":"玄烨","text":"此君霜后青，密叶欲停雪。\n丛篁傍小山，清节依然洁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37094,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"静坐读书自喻","author":"玄烨","text":"壮年好血气，半老少知闻。\n顾諟惟当谨，铭盘不至宭。\n励精勉图治，旰食尽民殷。\n性理宗濂洛，临摹仿鹅群。\n煌煌劳梦想，济济咏南薰。\n悬钟是进德，止辇问停云。\n怀保编氓苦，惠鲜鳏寡煴。\n留心刑服念，鄙笑图书焚。\n优礼任舟楫，凭轩尊典坟。\n前星诫琢磨，帝子识群分。\n外戚无矜势，诸王惜旧勋。\n烽烟熄万里，瀚海畏三军。\n淮黄关国计，漕运致忧勤。\n土木毋轻动，民情宜所欣。\n志广则宽裕，神清息俗纷。\n由来恶旨酒，自喻喜玄纁。\n长歌咏白雪，论赋小横汾。\n几暇讲寥廓，提筹算紫氛。\n乾阳得复转，测景考斜曛。\n有始无终叹，为山一篑慬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37095,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏雁","author":"玄烨","text":"品清敛燕雀，高洁许宾鸿。\n衡阳时有忆，留伴佐雄风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37096,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立春","author":"玄烨","text":"淑景维新爆，竹声手调羹。\n词臣载笔赋，琼英学西京。\n凤阁龙楼昼，渐长物资生。\n劝官勉力尽，升平竹马迎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37097,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏弹琴","author":"玄烨","text":"流水高山志，清音本自虚。\n朱弦准古调，和气近宸居。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37098,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"四十一年除夕书怀","author":"玄烨","text":"平生宵旰志，七七又将过。\n忘寝愁旸雨，精心勉泰和。\n送寒辞故岁，待曙问民疴。\n莫论新春媚，预怜五噫歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37099,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赐云南法界寺讲经溥畹","author":"玄烨","text":"昆明度法语，滇海论新禅。\n万里虽云远，金经自有传。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37100,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"灯节戏作","author":"玄烨","text":"隐隐光风度柳条，千寻银箭列丹霄。\n龙衔火树开花看，欲见山青待雪消。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37101,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三渡齐河即事","author":"玄烨","text":"淑气霓旌绕，光风拂济川。\n曾经三次渡，未若十年前。\n疾苦劳宵旰，深恩赖保全。\n颇知民食重，安抚责臣贤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37102,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"趵突泉留题源清流洁四字","author":"玄烨","text":"突兀泉声涌净波，东流远近浴羲和。\n源清分派白云洁，不虑浮沙污水涡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37103,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜登泰山","author":"玄烨","text":"日斜登泰岱，岭腹隔层霄。\n深夜回銮处，便忘石磴遥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37104,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新柳","author":"玄烨","text":"畿内柳丝未出黄，江南柳色已成行。\n郁金枝上啼莺早，积翠河边待夕阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37105,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"览淮黄成","author":"玄烨","text":"殷勤久矣理淮黄，几度风尘授治方。\n九曲素称天下险，四来实为兆民伤。\n使清引浊须勤慎，分势开疏在不荒。\n虽奏安澜宽旰食，诫前善后奠金汤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37106,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登金山望长江","author":"玄烨","text":"烟云清处晓霞飞，万里滔滔映紫微。\n灵液渺茫浮淑气，孤峰峍崒照晴晖。\n花翻浪涌疑天色，风动帆张共德威。\n昼夜如斯莫间歇，体乾勉已识璿玑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37107,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虎丘","author":"玄烨","text":"秀壁名吴水，悬萝接紫霞。\n仁风期大吏，厚俗止纷华。\n停辇舆情问，开轩畎亩赊。\n笙歌陈勿用，意使尽桑麻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37108,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过云栖憩竹林下令人斸笋斸兰","author":"玄烨","text":"寻春二月幸云栖，满目天光入品题。\n密林布荫樵渔乐，幽柏成行蕙芷齐。\n浴手临泉开箨笋，傍岩倚石选蓬藜。\n馀杭风景西湖胜，未若山中待竹迷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37109,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"云栖归途遇雨","author":"玄烨","text":"钱江风雨促前旌，竹树缤纷细草萌。\n夹岸黎元瞻拜切，频施膏泽惬民情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37110,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"钱塘江潮","author":"玄烨","text":"相传冰岸雪崖势，滚滚掀翻拥怒涛。\n风静不闻千里浪，三临越地识江皋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37111,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西湖夜月","author":"玄烨","text":"月照清涟静不波，鸾箫象管夜来多。\n轻舟岂羡江湖胜，欲写无私属棹歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37112,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"癸未春二月二十日自杭回至苏州是夜雨二十一日朕欲北行地方大小官员百姓留住二十二日雨甚冉留不能起行二十三日雨晴又欲留故书怀以示","author":"玄烨","text":"踌躇星夜两河工，又至吴乡泊趠风。\n春雨姑苏留豹尾，黎情江浙恋青骢。\n翠华景从无云盖，遍覆时巡有折衷。\n不意龙蟠虎踞胜，岂因景物杂谦冲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37113,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巡省江浙见闾阎有起色示诸臣省刑爱民","author":"玄烨","text":"巡方不用驾楼船，白舫兰桡问市廛。\n和气成春知岁稔，清风布物爱时妍。\n齐民但示蒲鞭辱，报国应同竹节坚。\n莫恃才名轻庶政，冥冥中自有青天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37114,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"船泊无锡","author":"玄烨","text":"扬帆百馀里，警跸惠山泉。\n竹倚青松外，藤悬秀岭巅。\n垂杨初匝幔，新藻写澄渊。\n惟爱此清洁，开言点素笺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37115,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"至江宁百姓欢迎遮道志喜","author":"玄烨","text":"童叟欣迎步辇前，春风润雨万条烟。\n若非念切军民久，争得欢声祝八千。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37116,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行宫春雨作书竟日","author":"玄烨","text":"离宫暂驻辇，竟日检牙签。\n自愧书家奥，临池正笔传。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37117,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江宁道上口号","author":"玄烨","text":"白下回程傍竹林，平山水溜似鸣琴。\n星驰不为阴晴阻，瓜步城南念旧吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37118,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"下长江舟中作","author":"玄烨","text":"一鹭芦中起，双鸥沙上鸣。\n翠烟含碧嶂，瑞霭覆琼英。\n洲转牙樯乱，江流大块横。\n智仁山水德，动静也移情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37119,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自江宁至京口","author":"玄烨","text":"轻绡初霁引江干，隔岸芦洲映水寒。\n吴会人文因气秀，金焦峦势起弘观。\n往来客旅千重艗，上下波涛万里滩。\n逝者绵绵无歇息，利名今古视艰难。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37120,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登焦山","author":"玄烨","text":"风帆战舰入沙洲，不动云烟一豫游。\n只见晴光安水面，潮声静里卷潭湫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37121,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"维扬雨霁","author":"玄烨","text":"二十四桥夜雨收，蜀冈阜下水西流。\n禅心欲定沾泥絮，不为繁华紫绮裘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37122,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"见泰安等数州县饥民亟命设法赈济","author":"玄烨","text":"东路行辇到，人食正荐饥。\n呼庚儿女盼，宸游众所依。\n村中皆菜色，散去掩柴扉。\n救荒先发谷，转漕迅如飞。\n两旬无多日，有司报民归。\n地丁既已责，私派务全希。\n尽力专邦本，留意欲国肥。\n麦秋犹可望，黎命其庶几。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37123,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东八闸舟遇顺风志喜","author":"玄烨","text":"千里程途数日还，岸回转转抱清湾。\n云帆不用荃桡力，喜志恩从大内颁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37124,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阅两河告成事毕因有恩诏星夜回京至天津书怀","author":"玄烨","text":"阅河临南国，飞旆转金台。\n不畏中宵困，岂因华祝催。\n千秋明镜鉴，万寿鄙霞杯。\n沐雨栉风紧，恩从涣汗开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37125,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得万物静观皆自得","author":"玄烨","text":"布教皇风性理寻，右文惠化无私临。\n清閒静省危微志，宴坐动观人道心。\n天地浑元肃气象，乾坤阖辟识书林。\n圣贤雅颂原无远，实在存神咏四箴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37126,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"麦秋盈野志喜","author":"玄烨","text":"去冬盈尺雪占年，今夏翛翛麦陇全。\n万亩皆齐诞降谷，千家秀实已登阡。\n先忧旸雨惟民疾，后乐时丰纪玉笺。\n志喜雕虫晚学愧，薰风南至影花砖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37127,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将之山庄四首 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"畏暑心何胜，平明出玉墀。\n万几岂歇息，临政有畴咨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37128,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将之山庄四首 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"暖溜自平地，风光此日佳。\n暄波由近发，浩泽无津涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37129,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将之山庄四首 其三","author":"玄烨","text":"驻辇相风竿，临书羡五传。\n情澜分暑节，疏爽须葵扇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37130,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将之山庄四首 其四","author":"玄烨","text":"霖雨消尘迹，轻霞照野荆。\n词臣每扈从，上赏赋昆明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37131,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得绿树阴浓夏日长","author":"玄烨","text":"绿槐影荫碧纱厨，茂树纷纷叶渐殊。\n绵雨新霖消九夏，薰风初热未三驱。\n末垂蝉咽浓阴下，脩景云开炎暑无。\n长日山中吟咏毕，气清塞外鄙凉珠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37132,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"尖齐圆健笔之四德戏作四首 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"尖锐虽云利，锋铓日计摧。\n藏拙莫言巧，生花自有来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37133,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"尖齐圆健笔之四德戏作四首 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"齐之故有道，人一已千能。\n默运良为手，挥毫须敬承。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37134,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"尖齐圆健笔之四德戏作四首 其三","author":"玄烨","text":"圆活幽人本，珠玑三品详。\n刚方学米芾，宛转仿其昌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37135,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"尖齐圆健笔之四德戏作四首 其四","author":"玄烨","text":"健乃乾行体，才分不息功。\n书称钦若语，赓颂赖文风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37136,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古戍三绝 其一","author":"玄烨","text":"隐隐山头皆古戍，中原民力尽边城。\n曾闻父老经年战，回首生灵血泪盈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37137,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古戍三绝 其二","author":"玄烨","text":"金瓯永固识人和，万里烽烟发兴多。\n设使山林有暗晓，更须太息论如何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37138,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古戍三绝 其三","author":"玄烨","text":"旧日山中罢马叹，今时避暑乐清风。\n穷兵岂若为观德，仁义无私八表同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37139,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得雨洒石壁来","author":"玄烨","text":"润叶随风洗绿枝，群峰著雨尽离披。\n阴霖又念农家业，事事何烦先预知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37140,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]